      "created_at": "2018-02-05T16:41:12.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>\"Your lands\" are indeed lands where you have Presence. There's a glossary entry on this in the rulebook (of the base game), and it is explained on p. 13 of the rulebook under \"Presence and Sacred Sites\".</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>I don't think \"your lands\" is typically expanded out in other contexts; where do you see it explained more fully on the cards?</p>",
